# Checkout & orders

- Validate and price on the server in `createOrder` / `validateCheckout`. Client summary is UX only.
- Return `400` with `{ errors: [{ field?, message }] }` for validation failures; `201` with `{ orderId }` on success.
- Persist only `paymentLast4`, never full PAN, in stored orders.
- Tax = 8% of merchandise subtotal; shipping from `SHIPPING_OPTIONS` in `format.ts`.
- After successful checkout UI must `clearCart()` then navigate to `/order/{orderId}`.
- Keep `docs/API.md` and PRD acceptance criteria aligned with code changes.
